  m_text: "  In a post-apocalyptic world, humanity fell to a zombie virus, and the
    survivors now depend on rotten meat to survive. But the humid climate caused
    a multiplication of slimy and crawling creatures that put these supplies in risk.\n\n 
    Your mission is to use the zombies' abilities to protect the rotten meat from
    the invading pests. Collect points, buy towers, and defend your precious pile
    of meat!"
